-control/index.mdx","Visión general","Diseña quién puede acceder a Lamassu mediante principales, políticas, permisos sobre recursos y autorización de rutas HTTP.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/es/platform/administration/access-control",{"_77":343},"platform/administration/access-control/index.mdx",{"_51":345,"_58":70,"_53":346,"_64":347,"_73":-7,"_10":348,"_75":349},"es:platform/administration/access-control/data-model.mdx","Modelo de datos","Entidades y relaciones del esquema pki.json que utiliza authz para evaluar políticas de acceso.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/es/platform/administration/access-control/data-model",{"_77":350},"platform/administration/access-control/data-model.mdx","es:platform/administration/access-control",{"_210":353},"platform/administration/access-control/meta.json",{"_51":355,"_58":70,"_53":356,"_64":357,"_73":-7,"_10":358,"_75":359},"es:platform/administration/audit-logs.mdx","Registros de auditoría","Entiende qué eventos de auditoría genera Lamassu y cómo convertirlos en una pista durable.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/es/platform/administration/audit-logs",{"_77":360},"platform/administration/audit-logs.mdx",{"_51":362,"_58":70,"_53":363,"_64":364,"_73":-7,"_10":365,"_75":366},"es:platform/administration/alerts.mdx","Alertas y suscripciones","Envía eventos de la PKI a personas y sistemas externos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/es/platform/administration/alerts",{"_77":367},"platform/administration/alerts.mdx","es:platform/administration",{"_210":370},"platform/administration/meta.json","es:platform",{"_210":373},"platform/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/images/lamassu.svg\"/><img src=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/images/lamassu.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;vertical-align:middle;flex-shrink:0;object-fit:contain\"/>",{"_58":59,"_53":376,"_61":62,"_63":-7,"_64":377,"_66":-7,"_55":378,"_51":444,"_75":445,"_73":447},"Despliegue","Ejecuta Lamassu en tu entorno",[379,386,389,396,403,4